WEBVTT

01:40.940 --> 01:44.270
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.060 --> 01:47.200
[Episode 12]

02:06.950 --> 02:07.750
You're awake.

02:12.780 --> 02:13.950
Are you feeling uncomfortable anywhere?

02:14.910 --> 02:15.710
No.

02:21.510 --> 02:22.460
You were severely injured.

02:22.460 --> 02:23.870
It's better for you to rest in bed.

02:24.590 --> 02:25.710
I'm fine now.

02:32.230 --> 02:33.750
This is my friend Mei Shan's residence.

02:34.150 --> 02:35.630
He was the one who underwent the lightning tribulation.

02:35.910 --> 02:36.910
Lightning tribulation?

02:42.230 --> 02:43.430
Are you alright then?

02:47.240 --> 02:48.590
A tribulation's force is immense

02:48.590 --> 02:50.070
and you were sealed away for so long.

02:50.070 --> 02:51.910
Your essence blood has been severely depleted.

02:51.910 --> 02:52.990
How could you disregard yourself

02:52.990 --> 02:54.510
and take on someone else's calamity?

02:54.829 --> 02:55.950
Do you have a death wish?

02:58.990 --> 03:00.150
Apart from creating things,

03:00.150 --> 03:01.550
what other skills do you have?

03:01.630 --> 03:02.510
And how dare you

03:02.510 --> 03:03.670
block a lightning strike for me?

03:04.030 --> 03:05.030
I'm different.

03:05.230 --> 03:06.190
How are you different?

03:06.190 --> 03:07.190
I made a promise

03:07.190 --> 03:08.510
to protect you well.

03:08.510 --> 03:09.390
Of course, I can't let you

03:09.390 --> 03:10.870
lose your life right before my eyes.

03:11.310 --> 03:12.110
However,

03:13.390 --> 03:14.310
you need to learn

03:14.310 --> 03:15.700
to protect yourself well.

03:15.990 --> 03:17.390
I can't save you again.

03:17.700 --> 03:19.190
If you encounter such a problem again,

03:19.540 --> 03:21.070
I won't be able to intervene.

03:22.070 --> 03:23.190
Who did you promise?

03:24.590 --> 03:25.620
When did you promise them?

03:26.670 --> 03:28.280
And why can't you intervene again?

03:30.020 --> 03:31.360
I can't tell you.

03:31.360 --> 03:32.150
You...

03:35.870 --> 03:37.270
Is this Baitou Mountain?

03:38.510 --> 03:39.310
You've been here before?

03:40.460 --> 03:41.380
Yes, I have.

03:41.900 --> 03:42.960
But before,

03:43.710 --> 03:45.220
this wasn't the name.

04:09.950 --> 04:10.790
Something's not right.

04:11.790 --> 04:12.670
What's not right?

04:13.310 --> 04:14.550
I used divination

04:14.550 --> 04:16.430
to calculate Tanyin's fortune for this journey.

04:16.470 --> 04:18.310
The result shows it's still a mix of good and bad luck,

04:18.310 --> 04:19.390
unclear and obscure.

04:19.390 --> 04:21.350
It's exactly the same as the previous result,

04:21.350 --> 04:22.500
with no changes.

04:22.710 --> 04:23.550
How could that be?

04:24.070 --> 04:25.990
Then how do you explain Tanyin's dream?

04:26.190 --> 04:27.340
We are gods.

04:27.670 --> 04:28.680
We don't simply have

04:28.680 --> 04:29.910
insignificant dreams.

04:31.000 --> 04:31.950
What do you think?

04:32.230 --> 04:33.390
Didn't Tanyin say

04:33.390 --> 04:34.550
the High Priest

04:34.550 --> 04:36.110
almost killed her in her dream?

04:37.080 --> 04:38.270
Isn't it obvious?

04:38.630 --> 04:39.870
This person stole the Divine Hand

04:39.870 --> 04:40.950
and killed countless people.

04:41.030 --> 04:42.860
He must have learned Tanyin's identity

04:42.909 --> 04:45.190
and decided to strike first to kill the god and seize the Divine Hand.

04:45.830 --> 04:47.390
It's not impossible.

04:48.030 --> 04:49.480
How can you interpret it

04:49.480 --> 04:50.909
so simplistically and crudely?

04:50.909 --> 04:52.120
In Tanyin's dream,

04:52.120 --> 04:53.860
there was also Deity Taihe.

04:54.510 --> 04:55.510
If it's what you said,

04:55.780 --> 04:57.750
then how do you explain Taihe's presence?

04:58.590 --> 04:59.390
Hannv,

04:59.750 --> 05:02.430
I know you're worried about Taihe,

05:02.750 --> 05:04.340
but the five Preceptors of Discipline

05:04.340 --> 05:05.870
of the Discipline Hall

05:05.870 --> 05:07.630
have already made their decision.

05:07.670 --> 05:10.270
We can only obey.

05:19.680 --> 05:20.650
This... this...

05:23.190 --> 05:25.550
May I ask where you're from

05:25.730 --> 05:26.810
and which clan you belong to?

05:28.110 --> 05:30.190
I'm from Pingzhou. I'm of the human race.

05:31.030 --> 05:31.820
Pingzhou?

05:32.870 --> 05:33.670
Pingzhou...

05:33.860 --> 05:35.870
Are there any... any immortal caves there?

05:37.830 --> 05:38.830
Did your ancestors

05:39.040 --> 05:40.440
also have this kind of

05:40.750 --> 05:42.630
talent for resurrection?

05:46.590 --> 05:48.230
I see that you have extraordinary potential

05:48.230 --> 05:49.790
and you're not afraid of the harm from heavenly lightning.

05:50.150 --> 05:52.150
I wonder if you've had any

05:52.470 --> 05:54.190
extraordinary encounters?

05:54.790 --> 05:55.630
No, I haven't.

05:57.040 --> 05:57.990
Then, then, then...

05:59.190 --> 05:59.990
Is it

06:00.070 --> 06:01.550
related to the techniques you've practiced?

06:01.550 --> 06:02.940
Can't you ask something useful?

06:05.430 --> 06:06.230
Haven't...

06:06.510 --> 06:08.110
Haven't you been suspicious of her all along?

06:08.150 --> 06:09.230
I was just asking on your behalf, wasn't I?

06:09.230 --> 06:10.180
Mind your own business.

06:10.270 --> 06:11.910
Hey, you're so ungrateful.

06:12.030 --> 06:13.630
I'm thinking for you.

06:13.910 --> 06:14.710
She took

06:14.710 --> 06:15.550
such a big risk for you,

06:15.550 --> 06:16.190
suffering the lightning,

06:16.190 --> 06:16.950
and saved your life.

06:16.950 --> 06:17.910
Yet you're still here,

06:17.910 --> 06:18.550
questioning her.

06:18.550 --> 06:19.550
Where are your manners?

06:19.550 --> 06:20.550
I didn't ask.

06:21.950 --> 06:22.670
You didn't ask?

06:22.670 --> 06:23.590
Even just thinking about it

06:23.590 --> 06:24.630
is impolite.

06:24.670 --> 06:26.110
What's your relationship with her now?

06:26.110 --> 06:27.710
This is a life-and-death relationship.

06:27.710 --> 06:29.390
Yet you keep suspecting her.

06:29.750 --> 06:30.550
You're utterly heartless.

06:30.550 --> 06:31.630
Utterly heartless.

06:31.710 --> 06:32.510
Mei Shan,

06:32.950 --> 06:34.830
I called you here to check her legs.

06:34.830 --> 06:35.990
If you're not going to treat her,

06:36.390 --> 06:37.390
then get out.

06:38.820 --> 06:39.909
Understood, understood.

06:53.310 --> 06:54.110
How is it?

07:00.310 --> 07:01.590
Pardon my frankness,

07:02.130 --> 07:04.940
but the nerves and muscles in her legs are severely damaged.

07:05.750 --> 07:06.550
I'm afraid

07:07.410 --> 07:09.210
there's no possibility of recovery.

07:10.510 --> 07:11.710
Even you can't do anything?

07:12.180 --> 07:14.300
I can make her a pair of crutches.

07:14.320 --> 07:15.090
Does that count?

07:17.710 --> 07:18.750
Don't worry.

07:18.750 --> 07:19.750
I'll be fine.

07:20.190 --> 07:20.990
It's okay.

07:21.350 --> 07:22.270
If he can't cure you,

07:22.510 --> 07:23.750
I'll find someone else to treat you.

07:23.910 --> 07:24.990
There must be a way.

07:25.790 --> 07:26.750
I believe you.

07:28.420 --> 07:29.430
Excuse me, you two,

07:29.430 --> 07:30.390
could you please respect

07:30.390 --> 07:31.350
my diagnosis?

07:31.350 --> 07:32.110
If I say

07:32.110 --> 07:33.030
these legs can't be cured,

07:33.030 --> 07:33.950
no one can make it happen.

07:33.950 --> 07:35.070
Didn't you say yesterday

07:35.070 --> 07:36.510
that if she could come back to life,

07:36.510 --> 07:37.710
you'd take off your head

07:37.710 --> 07:38.920
and use it as a stool?

07:38.990 --> 07:39.550
Go on.

07:39.550 --> 07:40.750
Children should be seen but not heard.

07:40.750 --> 07:42.030
If you don't speak, no one will miss you.

07:42.550 --> 07:43.470
Thank you,

07:43.870 --> 07:45.430
but I still prefer to believe

07:45.430 --> 07:46.510
what Yuanzhong said.

07:47.909 --> 07:48.710
Young lady,

07:49.380 --> 07:50.510
I have a question

07:50.630 --> 07:52.150
I'd like to discuss with you.

07:53.220 --> 07:55.750
This selfless spirit of yours,

07:55.780 --> 07:57.860
this noble quality of sacrificing yourself for others,

07:58.470 --> 07:59.909
is it innate

08:00.110 --> 08:01.630
or acquired later in life?

08:02.150 --> 08:03.100
To be honest,

08:03.240 --> 08:05.030
I'd like to be friends with you.

08:05.860 --> 08:07.230
The kind that can withstand heavenly thunder for me.

08:09.030 --> 08:09.820
Zi Fei.

08:10.290 --> 08:11.800
Young lady, listen to me.

08:11.840 --> 08:12.550
To be frank…

08:12.590 --> 08:13.360
Go, go, go.

08:13.390 --> 08:14.620
When I saw your brave act

08:14.620 --> 08:15.350
of facing the thunder,

08:15.350 --> 08:16.350
I developed

08:16.350 --> 08:17.550
a deep admiration for you!

08:17.550 --> 08:18.670
Young lady, let's be friends!

08:18.670 --> 08:19.190
Let's go.

08:19.190 --> 08:19.550
Young lady!

08:19.550 --> 08:20.270
Go out!

08:20.470 --> 08:21.260
Young lady!

08:23.430 --> 08:24.870
That's just how Mei Shan is.

08:24.870 --> 08:25.990
He's a bit crazy.

08:26.390 --> 08:27.510
Don't take it to heart.

08:36.850 --> 08:39.020
Wh-Why are you staring at me?

08:42.539 --> 08:44.179
I just have a lot of questions I want to ask you.

08:44.950 --> 08:46.070
But I also know

08:46.590 --> 08:47.540
that even if I ask,

08:48.410 --> 08:49.490
there won't be any answers.

08:55.220 --> 08:56.030
Are you hungry?

08:58.470 --> 08:59.270
A little.

09:00.040 --> 09:01.310
I'll go get you something to eat.

09:16.310 --> 09:17.390
Reporting to the deity,

09:17.940 --> 09:19.630
I have dispatched the elites of our clan.

09:20.030 --> 09:21.910
We vow to reclaim the God-Slaying Dagger.

09:22.700 --> 09:23.610
Please

09:24.030 --> 09:25.710
give my clan one more chance.

09:26.270 --> 09:27.430
You don't even know

09:27.430 --> 09:29.390
if your clansmen are alive or dead.

09:29.720 --> 09:31.190
How will you find them

09:31.230 --> 09:32.780
and reclaim the God-Slaying Dagger?

09:33.350 --> 09:35.070
The mortal realm is vast,

09:35.070 --> 09:36.320
with countless living beings.

09:36.670 --> 09:37.750
With your current

09:37.750 --> 09:38.960
manpower and abilities,

09:38.960 --> 09:40.550
trying to find the dagger

09:40.590 --> 09:42.300
is like searching for a needle in the haystack.

09:42.870 --> 09:44.710
How can I trust you?

09:45.150 --> 09:46.140
If I may speak,

09:46.190 --> 09:48.310
although our clan is in a difficult situation now,

09:48.310 --> 09:49.710
we are not without allies.

09:50.470 --> 09:52.230
I have sent people to contact them

09:52.630 --> 09:54.150
and ask for their assistance.

09:54.700 --> 09:55.870
There's no time.

09:56.270 --> 09:58.030
We must prepare for both possibilities.

09:58.670 --> 10:00.230
I've heard that the War Demon Clan

10:00.230 --> 10:01.350
has a secret technique

10:01.350 --> 10:02.630
called Possessing.

10:03.190 --> 10:05.150
It's said that if certain conditions are met,

10:05.190 --> 10:06.630
one can control someone's body

10:06.630 --> 10:08.100
from thousands of miles away,

10:08.270 --> 10:09.550
making them live

10:09.550 --> 10:11.070
or die at will.

10:11.350 --> 10:12.590
Is this true?

10:12.870 --> 10:13.670
Yes.

10:14.340 --> 10:16.020
What are those necessary conditions

10:16.020 --> 10:16.630
that must be met?

10:32.550 --> 10:33.590
War Demons?

10:35.870 --> 10:36.830
Do you really want to use them

10:36.830 --> 10:38.900
to perform the possessing technique against Yuanzhong?

10:39.310 --> 10:40.870
If they were capable of succeeding,

10:41.430 --> 10:42.470
they wouldn't have been chased

10:42.470 --> 10:43.440
for so many years,

10:43.630 --> 10:45.310
unable to see the light of day.

10:45.390 --> 10:47.230
I have my own considerations in what I do.

10:47.260 --> 10:48.720
There's no need for you to worry.

11:28.420 --> 11:29.470
Still don't feel anything?

11:35.350 --> 11:36.710
But you don't need to worry.

11:36.780 --> 11:38.310
I'm just too badly injured.

11:38.350 --> 11:39.270
It will take some time

11:39.270 --> 11:40.270
to recover.

11:40.950 --> 11:42.110
I'm not worried.

11:42.790 --> 11:44.470
It's just that if you don't get better,

11:45.140 --> 11:46.350
I don't want to have a cripple

11:46.350 --> 11:47.180
as a handmaiden.

11:57.860 --> 12:00.060
Look, what a nice girl.

12:01.000 --> 12:02.510
Her legs are so badly injured,

12:02.710 --> 12:04.590
yet she's still putting on a brave façade.

12:04.990 --> 12:06.510
If I can't be friends with her,

12:07.670 --> 12:09.480
it must be against the will of heaven

12:10.110 --> 12:11.240
and I deserve to be struck by lightning.

12:11.510 --> 12:12.630
Are you really trying to

12:12.630 --> 12:13.630
befriend her?

12:13.840 --> 12:15.880
I'm almost embarrassed to expose your true intentions.

12:16.500 --> 12:17.630
Why wouldn't I be?

12:18.750 --> 12:21.310
Don't doubt my sincerity in making friends.

12:22.310 --> 12:23.670
You have ulterior motives.

12:23.720 --> 12:25.440
You just want her to help you bear the lightning.

12:26.950 --> 12:28.660
I don't like what you're saying.

12:28.660 --> 12:29.550
Let me ask you,

12:29.720 --> 12:30.510
when making friends,

12:30.570 --> 12:32.530
shouldn't we be open and honest with each other?

12:32.630 --> 12:33.870
When a friend encounters difficulties,

12:33.870 --> 12:35.900
shouldn't we be willing to go through thick and thin for them?

12:36.230 --> 12:37.070
In the end,

12:37.200 --> 12:37.990
you just want her

12:37.990 --> 12:39.190
to help you bear the tribulation.

12:40.180 --> 12:41.060
Young man,

12:41.060 --> 12:42.750
you need to have a longer-term perspective.

12:42.750 --> 12:44.390
If she encounters any difficulties in the future,

12:44.390 --> 12:46.390
I will certainly rush to her aid without hesitation.

12:46.830 --> 12:47.990
I'd even hold up

12:47.990 --> 12:49.910
the sky for her if it fell, let alone bearing lightning,

12:51.230 --> 12:52.950
Anyone can make empty promises.

12:52.950 --> 12:54.750
I could even give my life for Yuanzhong.

13:10.190 --> 13:11.110
What are you thinking about?

13:19.580 --> 13:22.310
When do you plan to break the seal?

13:25.430 --> 13:26.470
In the next few days.

13:28.950 --> 13:29.910
You're ready?

13:32.590 --> 13:34.790
Alright, then in the future,

13:35.390 --> 13:36.150
if there's anything

13:36.150 --> 13:37.310
you need me for,

13:37.990 --> 13:39.070
just let me know.

13:39.750 --> 13:40.550
I will.

13:41.830 --> 13:44.390
Can't you show some courtesy?

13:44.740 --> 13:46.020
I did it in my head.

13:46.790 --> 13:48.230
I almost made myself sick.

13:57.500 --> 13:58.380
What are

13:59.030 --> 14:00.310
your plans for that girl?

14:05.550 --> 14:06.350
I haven't decided yet.

14:07.860 --> 14:08.630
Well, it seems

14:08.630 --> 14:09.990
she has no future with you.

14:09.990 --> 14:11.990
How about she stay and help me bear the lightning instead?

14:13.480 --> 14:14.270
See?

14:14.290 --> 14:15.410
You're reluctant to let her go, aren't you?

14:20.830 --> 14:21.990
I can't figure her out.

14:22.950 --> 14:24.590
Who doesn't have some secrets?

14:24.590 --> 14:25.360
Don't you have any?

14:25.360 --> 14:26.190
Don't I have any?

14:28.270 --> 14:29.190
I mean, I don't know

14:29.190 --> 14:30.030
what she's after.

14:30.030 --> 14:31.470
She's after you, of course.

14:31.470 --> 14:32.470
It's such a simple matter.

14:33.070 --> 14:34.190
I think the girl

14:34.190 --> 14:35.590
has fallen for you.

14:35.870 --> 14:36.940
To protect you,

14:36.940 --> 14:38.070
she's even willing to give up her life.

14:38.230 --> 14:39.510
Where else would you find

14:39.510 --> 14:41.070
such a devoted and good girl like her?

14:41.070 --> 14:42.190
If it weren't for the fact that

14:42.470 --> 14:44.470
my heart already belongs to someone else,

14:44.550 --> 14:45.950
even I would be moved.

14:49.510 --> 14:50.310
I'm telling you,

14:50.590 --> 14:53.030
you should trust the judgment of someone who has experience.

14:53.380 --> 14:55.750
Yuanzhong, you're still young.

14:55.840 --> 14:57.390
You haven't seen such a situation before,

14:57.390 --> 14:58.830
so it's understandable.

14:59.630 --> 15:01.470
Don't take yourself

15:01.470 --> 15:02.230
too seriously.

15:02.440 --> 15:03.190
Of course,

15:03.190 --> 15:04.670
you can't disregard

15:04.670 --> 15:05.580
others' feelings either.

15:06.070 --> 15:07.350
Feelings are something

15:07.650 --> 15:08.760
that can disappear in an instant.

15:10.300 --> 15:11.110
When that happens,

15:11.210 --> 15:13.450
you won't even know who to cry to.

15:14.470 --> 15:15.450
Seriously.

15:45.540 --> 15:48.620
♫Too many old dreams♫

15:48.650 --> 15:51.970
♫Where did the snow fall to?♫

15:52.760 --> 15:56.470
♫Going to face a catastrophe♫

15:56.550 --> 15:59.670
♫No one is irrelevant♫

16:00.430 --> 16:01.590
She's likes me?

16:02.230 --> 16:03.720
What does that have to do with me?

16:03.170 --> 16:06.100
♫A slight ripple in my gaze♫

16:06.140 --> 16:09.510
♫Who knows the warmth and cold of my fleeting life?♫

16:10.030 --> 16:10.830
Ji Tanyin.

16:10.260 --> 16:14.230
♫If staying together is difficult, it's not worth it♫

16:13.430 --> 16:14.230
Ji Tanyin?

16:14.250 --> 16:17.590
♫I'll return what's left of my life♫

16:18.360 --> 16:20.560
♫Falling into the mortal world♫

16:20.580 --> 16:22.780
♫Wandering through the clouds and rivers♫

16:23.010 --> 16:26.620
♫Being by your side is like finding the shore♫

16:24.630 --> 16:25.430
Ji Tanyin?

16:26.910 --> 16:29.110
♫If between oaths♫

16:29.420 --> 16:31.400
♫I hold onto the longing for just one more glance♫

16:29.630 --> 16:30.430
Ji Tanyin!

16:31.430 --> 16:35.170
♫Unwilling to bid farewell for good♫

16:35.780 --> 16:37.990
♫Tears grow cold in a single cup♫

16:38.010 --> 16:40.170
♫Longing fades in half♫

16:40.390 --> 16:44.580
♫Like flowers in a mirror, or the moon in the water♫

16:45.220 --> 16:52.380
♫A thousand years of long nights, yearning from dawn to dusk♫

16:55.260 --> 16:58.200
♫A slight ripple in my gaze♫

16:58.230 --> 17:01.610
♫Who knows the warmth and cold of my fleeting life?♫

17:02.440 --> 17:06.400
♫If staying together is difficult, it's not worth it♫

17:06.440 --> 17:09.770
♫I'll return what's left of my life♫

17:10.530 --> 17:12.730
♫Falling into the mortal world♫

17:12.760 --> 17:14.960
♫Wandering through the clouds and rivers♫

17:15.190 --> 17:18.800
♫Being by your side is like finding the shore♫

17:19.369 --> 17:21.369
♫The moon falls by the riverbank♫

17:21.400 --> 17:23.599
♫The light finally dims♫

17:23.660 --> 17:27.470
♫How can my heart be at ease?♫

17:27.970 --> 17:30.170
♫Tears grow cold in a single cup♫

17:30.200 --> 17:32.360
♫Longing fades in half♫

17:32.570 --> 17:36.760
♫Like flowers in a mirror, or the moon in the water♫

17:37.490 --> 17:44.810
♫The lonely guest can't sleep, destiny can't be undone; speechless♫

17:45.650 --> 17:47.880
♫Falling into the mortal world♫

17:47.920 --> 17:49.790
♫Wandering through the clouds and rivers♫

17:50.090 --> 17:53.990
♫Being by your side is like finding the shore♫

17:54.250 --> 17:56.480
♫The moon falls by the riverbank♫

17:56.480 --> 17:58.500
♫The light finally dims♫

17:58.710 --> 18:01.950
♫How can my heart be at ease?♫

18:02.860 --> 18:05.260
♫Tears grow cold in a single cup♫

18:05.260 --> 18:07.460
♫Longing fades in half♫

18:07.520 --> 18:11.930
♫Like flowers in a mirror, or the moon in the water♫

18:12.210 --> 18:22.390
♫The lonely guest can't sleep, destiny can't be undone; speechless♫

18:23.870 --> 18:25.390
Why didn't you stay in your room?

18:25.390 --> 18:26.390
Why did you go there?

18:27.070 --> 18:28.260
I-I was just

18:28.260 --> 18:29.510
taking a bath.

18:29.670 --> 18:30.720
After being unconscious for so long,

18:30.720 --> 18:31.830
I must have smelled awful.

18:32.270 --> 18:33.150
As for you,

18:33.780 --> 18:35.470
as the High Priest of the Youhu Clan,

18:35.590 --> 18:37.190
don't you know it's improper to peek?

18:37.190 --> 18:38.790
How dare you stand there and watch?

18:39.910 --> 18:41.350
I wasn't peeking.

18:41.350 --> 18:42.670
I was just passing by.

18:44.830 --> 18:46.150
Your legs are injured so badly.

18:46.150 --> 18:47.470
How could you go so far?

18:48.550 --> 18:50.100
A mechanical bird carried me there.

18:53.190 --> 18:53.990
Hold on tight.

19:18.590 --> 19:20.230
Here, have some water.

19:20.750 --> 19:21.550
Thank you.

19:35.090 --> 19:36.240
Here you go.

19:42.550 --> 19:43.670
I'm fine.

19:44.600 --> 19:47.480
Well then, you should rest.

19:47.910 --> 19:48.790
I'll be going now.

19:49.750 --> 19:50.550
Do you have something

19:50.550 --> 19:51.630
you want to say to me?

19:55.350 --> 19:56.150
No.

19:57.230 --> 19:59.470
Then I have something to tell you.

20:00.470 --> 20:01.430
Sit here.

20:20.110 --> 20:21.430
Don't you have something to say?

20:24.630 --> 20:25.430
What are you laughing about?

20:26.630 --> 20:27.910
You don't want to send me away anymore,

20:27.910 --> 20:28.710
do you?

20:30.340 --> 20:31.370
Who told you that?

20:32.230 --> 20:33.350
I can see it

20:33.350 --> 20:34.430
in your eyes.

20:38.750 --> 20:39.540
That's good.

20:40.030 --> 20:42.430
At least that strike wasn't for nothing.

20:42.790 --> 20:43.910
You have no idea

20:43.960 --> 20:45.910
how painful that purple lightning was.

20:46.070 --> 20:47.590
If there had been another strike,

20:47.630 --> 20:49.550
I might have been reduced to ashes.

20:49.910 --> 20:50.910
If you're afraid,

20:51.350 --> 20:52.710
you should stay far away.

20:53.430 --> 20:54.230
That won't do.

20:54.310 --> 20:55.150
I have to follow you

20:55.150 --> 20:56.350
and be with you.

21:15.990 --> 21:16.790
Ji Tanyin.

21:18.020 --> 21:19.080
You don't know me.

21:19.260 --> 21:20.390
I do know you.

21:21.000 --> 21:22.780
I think I'm the person in this world

21:22.780 --> 21:24.030
who knows you best.

21:25.790 --> 21:27.150
Why do you always say that?

21:27.640 --> 21:29.190
Because I've seen it.

21:30.740 --> 21:32.380
I don't even know what you're talking about.

21:33.150 --> 21:34.430
You're so weird.

21:34.950 --> 21:36.440
Anyway, even if you follow me,

21:37.590 --> 21:38.830
you won't gain anything.

21:39.110 --> 21:40.430
You can't change anything either.

21:44.870 --> 21:45.990
When this matter is over,

21:46.790 --> 21:48.470
I'll find someone to heal your legs.

21:49.510 --> 21:50.870
Then, whether you stay or leave

21:52.150 --> 21:53.190
will be entirely up to you.

21:53.630 --> 21:54.870
I won't leave.

21:59.150 --> 21:59.940
If you follow me,

22:00.380 --> 22:01.590
you'll still be a handmaiden.

22:01.610 --> 22:02.850
That's already good enough for me.

22:06.880 --> 22:08.000
Silly.

22:12.390 --> 22:13.790
A new store has opened over there.

22:13.790 --> 22:14.310
Really?

22:14.310 --> 22:15.230
Let's go check it out sometime.

22:15.230 --> 22:15.870
Okay.

22:18.910 --> 22:20.460
They have a complete selection of items inside.

22:20.460 --> 22:21.270
Is that so?

23:39.950 --> 23:41.510
Miss, there's a gentleman

23:41.510 --> 23:42.870
who invites you to dine with him.

23:47.070 --> 23:48.430
Friends have come from afar.

23:48.430 --> 23:49.840
Naturally, I'm delighted.

23:49.950 --> 23:52.590
I've specially prepared a table of food and drinks

23:52.610 --> 23:54.610
to welcome the three of you.

23:55.120 --> 23:57.120
May our friendship stay evergreen,

23:57.350 --> 23:58.750
as enduring as heaven and earth,

23:58.750 --> 24:00.270
and as eternal as the sun and moon.

24:00.290 --> 24:01.290
Come, eat up.

24:06.470 --> 24:07.990
Please start eating.

24:08.320 --> 24:09.470
No need to be so polite with me.

24:11.150 --> 24:12.030
Excuse me, everyone.

24:12.350 --> 24:14.270
Could someone please settle the bill for the food and drinks first?

24:19.510 --> 24:20.550
Why are you looking at me?

24:20.550 --> 24:21.190
Don't forget,

24:21.190 --> 24:22.830
I still owe you half a year's worth of drink tabs.

24:22.830 --> 24:23.470
You...

24:28.550 --> 24:29.510
I don't have money either.

24:32.110 --> 24:33.020
No way.

24:33.480 --> 24:34.550
How long the light

24:34.550 --> 24:35.950
of our friendship can last

24:35.970 --> 24:37.260
all depends on you now.

24:37.510 --> 24:38.790
Surely you won't

24:38.790 --> 24:39.550
heartlessly

24:39.550 --> 24:40.710
extinguish it over the cost of one meal, would you?

24:40.830 --> 24:41.790
You should know

24:41.800 --> 24:42.810
that in my heart,

24:42.850 --> 24:44.890
I've always believed you to be a good person.

24:45.270 --> 24:46.740
Does being a good person mean you must have money?

24:47.180 --> 24:48.110
Besides,

24:48.110 --> 24:48.790
wasn't this meal

24:48.790 --> 24:49.830
supposed to be your treat for everyone?

24:49.830 --> 24:50.430
Why must

24:50.430 --> 24:51.500
someone else pay for you?

24:51.500 --> 24:52.790
That's right, Mei Shan.

24:52.870 --> 24:53.750
You're an immortal,

24:53.750 --> 24:54.750
yet you've ended up like this.

24:54.830 --> 24:56.030
Aren't you ashamed?

24:57.750 --> 24:59.030
I don't want to be like this either.

24:59.140 --> 25:00.590
Every 49 days,

25:00.590 --> 25:01.910
I get struck by lightning once.

25:02.030 --> 25:03.630
All my time is spent

25:03.630 --> 25:05.550
enduring lightning, cultivating, and recovering from injuries.

25:05.580 --> 25:06.820
How can I find time to make money?

25:07.780 --> 25:11.540
How about we continue to put it on the tab?

25:12.670 --> 25:13.520
Listen, you all,

25:13.520 --> 25:14.710
you're immortals after all.

25:15.670 --> 25:16.630
Surely you can't be unable

25:16.630 --> 25:17.580
to scrape together the price of a meal, right?

25:17.750 --> 25:18.550
Look.

25:18.670 --> 25:19.630
What's so special about this?

25:19.630 --> 25:20.750
You know me, don't you?

25:20.750 --> 25:21.390
There are indeed immortals

25:21.390 --> 25:22.670
so poor they can't even afford a meal.

25:23.590 --> 25:24.380
Zi Fei.

25:31.950 --> 25:32.870
Thank you, immortal.

25:37.110 --> 25:37.910
Alright.

25:38.790 --> 25:39.990
Then, this first cup of wine

25:40.230 --> 25:43.540
is to toast me for surviving the tribulation.

25:44.710 --> 25:45.790
Surely good fortune will follow.

25:46.380 --> 25:47.940
The next tribulation is approaching soon.

25:49.230 --> 25:50.270
For such matters,

25:50.270 --> 25:51.670
we do our best and leave the rest to fate.

25:51.750 --> 25:53.190
If all else fails, to hell with it.

25:53.190 --> 25:54.630
Drink some wine, gaze at the sky,

25:54.790 --> 25:56.270
and live one day at a time, right?

25:56.310 --> 25:57.390
Come, let's drink.

25:59.820 --> 26:00.630
Cheers!

26:09.150 --> 26:11.430
Miss Ji is not good at drinking.

26:11.950 --> 26:13.230
I usually do drink a little,

26:13.350 --> 26:15.470
but this wine is really too strong.

26:16.310 --> 26:17.510
That's because you haven't drunk enough.

26:17.510 --> 26:18.070
Drink some more

26:18.070 --> 26:19.070
and you'll even find it bland.

26:19.590 --> 26:20.550
Don't listen to his nonsense.

26:21.270 --> 26:22.870
Baitou Mountain is covered in snow year-round.

26:23.190 --> 26:24.710
The local mountain dwellers brew this wine

26:24.710 --> 26:26.430
specially to ward off the cold.

26:26.510 --> 26:27.710
It's easy to get drunk if you have too much.

26:28.100 --> 26:29.270
Then I won't drink anymore.

26:30.350 --> 26:31.150
Eat more.

26:34.310 --> 26:35.110
Thank you.

26:44.430 --> 26:45.350
Why do you two

26:45.350 --> 26:46.110
look sneaky?

26:46.900 --> 26:47.710
Do we?

26:47.750 --> 26:48.550
No.

26:56.670 --> 26:57.470
It didn't break?

26:59.850 --> 27:01.060
The material seems quite ordinary.

27:01.990 --> 27:03.230
This is something you don't know.

27:03.250 --> 27:04.650
Nothing on Baitou Mountain

27:04.710 --> 27:06.190
can be damaged by external forces.

27:06.230 --> 27:07.030
You won't be able to

27:07.030 --> 27:08.230
pluck a single leaf

27:08.250 --> 27:09.510
from the ordinary plants

27:09.510 --> 27:10.590
in this room,

27:10.590 --> 27:11.470
unless it falls down naturally.

27:11.590 --> 27:12.550
Is that so?

27:12.710 --> 27:13.510
Try it.

27:20.070 --> 27:21.580
It seems there's an invisible force

27:21.740 --> 27:22.890
protecting this place.

27:23.630 --> 27:25.030
It's fortunate that it is so.

27:25.030 --> 27:26.800
Otherwise, with me experiencing tribulations here year after year,

27:26.820 --> 27:28.730
this mountain would have been struck by lightning and destroyed long ago.

27:29.190 --> 27:30.590
Eat quickly. The food is getting cold.

27:38.790 --> 27:39.670
Don't you like it?

27:41.820 --> 27:43.430
I suddenly have a craving for roast goose.

27:46.430 --> 27:48.150
You like roast goose?

27:49.190 --> 27:50.350
Earlier on the tower ship,

27:50.350 --> 27:51.860
I saw others eating roast goose

27:51.860 --> 27:53.470
and thought it smelled delicious.

28:02.710 --> 28:03.790
Are your legs better?

28:06.000 --> 28:07.120
A little better.

28:07.430 --> 28:08.310
But I feel

28:08.450 --> 28:10.020
I can barely stand up.

28:10.590 --> 28:12.190
However, I believe it will heal soon.

28:13.310 --> 28:14.870
How can such a severe injury

28:15.320 --> 28:16.430
heal?

28:33.950 --> 28:34.740
What's wrong?

28:37.110 --> 28:38.550
Perhaps when I stood up earlier,

28:38.570 --> 28:39.540
I put too much strain on it,

28:40.430 --> 28:41.750
so it's a bit painful now.

29:10.910 --> 29:11.950
I'm only doing this because

29:12.190 --> 29:13.710
you took a hit for me.

29:14.550 --> 29:15.630
Don't overthink it.

29:20.030 --> 29:20.830
By the way,

29:21.310 --> 29:22.400
you and Mr. Mei Shan

29:22.420 --> 29:23.540
seem to be good friends.

29:23.820 --> 29:24.630
I guess.

29:24.950 --> 29:25.750
Besides me,

29:26.020 --> 29:27.550
no one else wants to be his friend.

29:28.630 --> 29:29.750
I heard earlier

29:29.830 --> 29:31.190
that you destroyed his cave dwelling

29:31.270 --> 29:32.550
and had a fight with him.

29:32.990 --> 29:33.790
How come

29:33.830 --> 29:35.350
you're now good friends?

29:36.220 --> 29:37.510
Because I showed mercy

29:37.870 --> 29:39.190
and spared his miserable life.

29:39.350 --> 29:41.440
He was grateful to me, worshipped me,

29:41.550 --> 29:42.740
and kowtowed to me.

29:42.740 --> 29:43.470
He shamelessly

29:43.470 --> 29:44.590
insisted on being my friend.

29:44.750 --> 29:46.310
I had no choice but to give in.

29:46.510 --> 29:47.630
I don't believe that.

29:48.390 --> 29:49.750
Having no choice but to give in

29:49.780 --> 29:50.710
is actually true.

29:51.390 --> 29:52.310
This guy

29:52.350 --> 29:53.630
is reckless when he goes crazy.

29:54.030 --> 29:55.630
But after all, I was in the wrong first.

29:55.870 --> 29:57.150
I destroyed his cave dwelling,

29:57.230 --> 29:59.020
so it wouldn't be right to go all out against him.

29:59.430 --> 30:00.750
So you apologized to him?

30:01.830 --> 30:03.440
It was a strategic compromise.

30:04.590 --> 30:05.550
What happened after that?

30:05.740 --> 30:06.550
After that...

30:07.870 --> 30:09.030
After that, something happened

30:09.030 --> 30:09.990
in the clan.

30:10.670 --> 30:12.430
My Divine Hand power was sealed.

30:12.830 --> 30:14.030
Kai Shan and the others

30:14.270 --> 30:15.710
were also sealed in different places.

30:16.710 --> 30:17.550
This Baitou Mountain

30:17.640 --> 30:19.110
is where Kai Shan is sealed.

30:19.590 --> 30:20.430
After that,

30:20.910 --> 30:23.310
Mei Shan helped me guard this place.

30:28.510 --> 30:29.310
Does it hurt?

30:30.190 --> 30:30.980
A little bit.

30:31.870 --> 30:33.980
Bear with it. It helps with recovery.

31:00.040 --> 31:00.960
Why are you looking at me?

31:02.390 --> 31:03.190
It's nothing.

31:03.630 --> 31:04.820
Am I not massaging well?

31:05.260 --> 31:06.110
It's fine.

31:06.840 --> 31:09.070
Just feels a bit tingly.

31:16.220 --> 31:18.180
That means it's almost healed.

31:19.780 --> 31:21.540
That's enough for today.

31:23.000 --> 31:24.350
You should rest now.

31:41.920 --> 31:42.710
Please.

31:45.560 --> 31:46.950
Esteemed guest,

31:47.550 --> 31:49.630
are you satisfied with this fish?

31:50.150 --> 31:51.110
Thank you, waiter.

31:51.230 --> 31:52.190
You're welcome, you're welcome.

31:52.190 --> 31:53.500
Enjoy your meal.

31:55.350 --> 31:56.670
This is bream from the Min River.

31:56.950 --> 31:58.150
The taste is exquisite.

31:58.470 --> 31:59.710
If we hadn't passed by here,

31:59.750 --> 32:01.230
we wouldn't have had such a delicacy.

32:02.060 --> 32:03.950
We're just passing acquaintances, Sir.

32:04.590 --> 32:06.150
I don't know why

32:06.170 --> 32:07.200
you've invited me here.

32:07.670 --> 32:09.390
We're not just passing acquaintances.

32:10.200 --> 32:11.230
Although it's a bit late,

32:11.470 --> 32:12.630
I still remembered you.

32:24.510 --> 32:25.830
This is liquor from the Min River.

32:25.980 --> 32:26.950
Though not a fine wine,

32:27.340 --> 32:28.790
it has its own unique flavor.

32:31.710 --> 32:32.510
Please.

32:43.750 --> 32:44.590
How does it taste?

32:50.710 --> 32:52.350
When did you remember me?

32:53.150 --> 32:54.990
You felt familiar when I first saw you.

32:55.590 --> 32:56.710
After thinking carefully,

32:57.270 --> 32:58.260
I remembered.

32:59.340 --> 33:00.920
Do you have something to tell me?

33:03.250 --> 33:05.040
This sword is quite special.

33:05.220 --> 33:06.340
The blade is a bit shorter.

33:06.570 --> 33:07.890
The hilt is also thinner.

33:08.360 --> 33:09.410
May I take a look?

33:31.400 --> 33:32.550
The hilt fits well in my hand.

33:34.550 --> 33:35.830
The blade is sharp enough too.

33:36.690 --> 33:37.600
It's a good sword.

33:38.920 --> 33:40.090
Does this sword have a name?

33:41.260 --> 33:42.350
You don't recognize it?

33:43.190 --> 33:44.470
Should I recognize it?

33:45.190 --> 33:45.920
Then why

33:45.920 --> 33:47.350
did you say you recognized me?

33:49.150 --> 33:50.670
You're a handmaiden from Xiaoxiang Peak.

33:51.470 --> 33:52.230
When I was confined by the Elders

33:52.230 --> 33:53.470
in Jinxia Palace,

33:53.860 --> 33:55.130
you came to clean the room.

34:01.440 --> 34:03.590
What? Did I remember wrong?

34:07.110 --> 34:07.920
No.

34:08.830 --> 34:09.989
You remembered correctly, Sir.

34:10.389 --> 34:12.270
I was indeed a handmaiden from Xiaoxiang Peak.

34:12.650 --> 34:14.159
We've met a few times.

34:15.150 --> 34:16.270
My status is humble.

34:16.440 --> 34:17.800
I'm flattered that you remember.

34:18.550 --> 34:19.340
Don't worry.

34:19.949 --> 34:20.870
Over these decades,

34:21.190 --> 34:22.670
it's not unheard of for human handmaidens

34:22.670 --> 34:24.030
to quietly slip away.

34:24.670 --> 34:25.429
I've come down the mountain this time

34:25.429 --> 34:26.670
for other important matters to attend to.

34:26.790 --> 34:27.840
I won't give you any trouble.

34:29.929 --> 34:31.050
You're so generous.

34:31.739 --> 34:33.139
Thank you so much, Sir.

34:33.750 --> 34:34.880
Judging by your physique,

34:35.350 --> 34:36.590
you must be trained in martial arts.

34:37.790 --> 34:39.030
Did you learn it before coming to the mountain?

34:41.389 --> 34:44.030
As a human, my status is lowly.

34:44.699 --> 34:45.530
Would anyone

34:45.679 --> 34:47.090
from Fangwai Mountain teach me martial arts there?

34:48.830 --> 34:49.750
Perhaps you think

34:49.750 --> 34:51.010
I learned it secretly?

34:51.750 --> 34:53.360
You seem to dislike me.

34:53.920 --> 34:54.540
I wouldn't dare.

34:56.909 --> 34:58.070
I'm just curious.

34:58.670 --> 35:00.310
Since you're trained in martial arts,

35:00.990 --> 35:02.550
why did you go to the mountain as a handmaiden?

35:08.030 --> 35:08.910
If you don't want to,

35:09.110 --> 35:10.070
you don't have to tell me.

35:10.470 --> 35:11.870
I'm just curious, that's all.

35:13.950 --> 35:15.350
I was looking for an answer.

35:16.590 --> 35:17.390
An answer?

35:18.590 --> 35:19.550
When I was young,

35:20.190 --> 35:21.390
I accidentally entered a spiritual mountain.

35:22.540 --> 35:24.020
All traces of life had vanished on the mountain.

35:24.700 --> 35:26.230
There was only the light of snow everywhere,

35:26.430 --> 35:27.830
as if blessed by the gods.

35:29.070 --> 35:29.870
I...

35:32.070 --> 35:33.350
I encountered a deer.

35:34.140 --> 35:35.420
It stood majestically

35:35.450 --> 35:36.770
in the wind and snow.

35:37.610 --> 35:38.730
I looked into its eyes

35:39.710 --> 35:40.740
and felt

35:40.760 --> 35:42.500
an unprecedented stirring in my heart.

35:43.710 --> 35:45.190
It was as if it were

35:45.750 --> 35:46.990
the only color in the world.

35:48.140 --> 35:49.100
I thought at the time

35:49.840 --> 35:50.990
that all things have spirits

35:51.580 --> 35:53.230
and our meeting was no coincidence.

35:53.910 --> 35:54.910
For many years after that,

35:55.310 --> 35:57.550
I searched for this deer.

35:58.350 --> 35:59.190
I heard

35:59.630 --> 36:01.390
it was a divine deer from the spiritual mountain.

36:01.970 --> 36:03.040
It was extremely rare.

36:03.580 --> 36:04.380
Perhaps...

36:10.750 --> 36:11.870
Perhaps something belonging to the divine race

36:11.870 --> 36:13.070
might be on Fangwai Mountain.

36:14.150 --> 36:15.390
I went up the mountain to serve as a handmaiden

36:16.110 --> 36:18.060
and searched for it for many years.

36:18.790 --> 36:19.870
Did you find it?

36:22.310 --> 36:24.190
Later, I did indeed see it again.

36:25.150 --> 36:26.300
Isn't that good?

36:26.820 --> 36:28.580
It's both good and not so good, I suppose.

36:31.870 --> 36:33.390
Its appearance hadn't changed,

36:34.000 --> 36:35.440
but it was completely different

36:36.150 --> 36:37.540
from the clear and transparent,

36:37.790 --> 36:38.830
ethereal,

36:39.500 --> 36:41.220
almost otherworldly feeling

36:41.250 --> 36:42.420
I remembered.

36:43.280 --> 36:44.710
So you were disappointed?

36:45.950 --> 36:47.310
I wouldn't say disappointed.

36:57.430 --> 36:58.830
So many years have passed.

36:59.710 --> 37:01.310
I can barely remember

37:01.590 --> 37:03.070
what it originally looked like.

37:04.230 --> 37:05.260
It was nothing more than

37:05.260 --> 37:06.550
an illusion

37:06.870 --> 37:07.870
that I had beautified

37:07.870 --> 37:08.950
many times in my mind.

37:09.390 --> 37:10.790
To judge the present version

37:10.790 --> 37:12.150
against an imagined one

37:12.350 --> 37:13.710
isn't fair to him.

37:15.430 --> 37:16.190
Perhaps the one I met

37:16.190 --> 37:17.280
back then

37:17.630 --> 37:19.230
wasn't his true self to begin with,

37:19.550 --> 37:20.950
but rather who I thought he was.

37:21.750 --> 37:22.590
Moreover,

37:25.310 --> 37:26.870
he had long forgotten about me.

37:27.990 --> 37:29.350
You seem to have deep insights.

37:30.830 --> 37:31.950
Not exactly.

37:33.070 --> 37:35.190
I've been trapped in my obsession for too many years.

37:35.470 --> 37:37.060
It's time to let go.

37:38.790 --> 37:39.720
How old are you?

37:40.600 --> 37:42.150
You're too young to talk about "too many years."

37:43.030 --> 37:44.070
But that's good.

37:44.990 --> 37:46.740
Wasting your life for a deer

37:47.450 --> 37:48.510
is truly unwise.

37:50.190 --> 37:51.430
You're right to admonish me, Sir.

37:58.010 --> 38:00.160
This sword seems destined for you, Sir.

38:01.990 --> 38:03.170
Please accept it as a gift.

38:02.980 --> 38:06.700
♫I gaze into your deep eyes♫

38:04.430 --> 38:05.340
What do you mean?

38:07.760 --> 38:11.380
♫For whom do you take apart the word "love"?♫

38:08.590 --> 38:10.180
Consider it a thank you for the wine you offered.

38:13.780 --> 38:17.420
♫Turning around, it's like a dream♫

38:18.400 --> 38:22.380
♫I have betrayed deep love♫

38:23.790 --> 38:27.880
♫Unable to get what I yearn for, I sink in sadness♫

38:29.410 --> 38:33.650
♫When I brush past love fate is set♫

38:34.410 --> 38:37.010
♫I've used up my brush and ink♫

38:37.280 --> 38:40.330
♫But I can't describe♫

38:40.500 --> 38:45.060
♫This lovesick path♫

38:57.780 --> 38:58.810
Kai Shan is right here.

38:59.140 --> 38:59.990
So you're saying

39:00.260 --> 39:01.030
he sealed himself

39:01.030 --> 39:02.680
in the hot spring?

39:03.590 --> 39:04.590
He found a good place, right?

39:06.170 --> 39:07.810
According to what the Divine Hand has detected,

39:08.190 --> 39:09.030
he's in an even deeper place

39:09.030 --> 39:10.030
below the hot spring.

39:10.310 --> 39:11.950
It's surrounded by scorching energy.

39:12.830 --> 39:14.580
What should we do? Let's fish him out.

39:21.220 --> 39:22.870
Kai Shan, return.

39:31.320 --> 39:32.630
Yuanzhong, up there.

39:46.220 --> 39:47.910
Tell me about the restrictions on this mountain

39:47.930 --> 39:49.290
and its original owner.

39:50.680 --> 39:52.030
Well, you're asking the wrong person.

39:52.230 --> 39:53.310
It's my first time seeing

39:53.310 --> 39:54.230
the full extent of the restrictions.

39:54.230 --> 39:55.020
As for this place

39:55.020 --> 39:56.630
and its former owner,

39:56.670 --> 39:58.230
I've never even met him.

40:00.830 --> 40:01.630
That's not right.

40:02.590 --> 40:03.270
This person set up

40:03.270 --> 40:04.670
such extensive restrictions.

40:04.990 --> 40:06.790
He couldn't have done it overnight.

40:07.670 --> 40:08.870
Surely their intention

40:09.270 --> 40:10.790
was to maintain the mountain's appearance

40:11.230 --> 40:12.390
and prevent others from damaging

40:12.390 --> 40:13.760
even a blade of grass and leaf on this mountain.

40:14.270 --> 40:15.190
How could he allow you

40:15.190 --> 40:16.550
to leisurely undergo your tribulations here?

40:18.580 --> 40:20.030
Well, if you put it that way,

40:20.040 --> 40:21.760
there is indeed something strange.

40:22.100 --> 40:23.710
When I first arrived here,

40:23.710 --> 40:24.540
there was always this old fellow

40:24.540 --> 40:25.390
who came to give me trouble

40:25.390 --> 40:26.390
and tried to drive me away.

40:26.590 --> 40:27.390
And then?

40:27.830 --> 40:28.750
Then I fought with him

40:28.750 --> 40:29.430
for several years.

40:29.430 --> 40:30.430
When he saw he couldn't do anything about me,

40:30.430 --> 40:31.590
he never came back.

40:34.180 --> 40:35.350
Divine artifacts have spirits.

40:35.680 --> 40:36.710
They wouldn't choose

40:36.710 --> 40:37.990
to seal themselves here without reason.

40:38.720 --> 40:39.950
Could it be because

40:39.950 --> 40:41.110
this place has restrictions

40:41.220 --> 40:42.020
that it's

40:42.020 --> 40:43.150
the safest for him?

40:43.780 --> 40:45.460
But the problem is it's too safe.

40:45.740 --> 40:47.140
Even I can't do anything about it.

40:49.750 --> 40:50.670
Don't tell me

40:50.670 --> 40:52.230
that you, the mighty host of the Divine Hand,

40:52.230 --> 40:52.910
can't break

40:52.910 --> 40:54.110
the restrictions here.

40:56.940 --> 40:58.060
You really can't break them?

40:59.230 --> 41:00.630
Forget about breaking the restrictions.

41:01.030 --> 41:02.390
I just tried to deduce it,

41:02.670 --> 41:03.630
but I couldn't even determine

41:03.630 --> 41:04.700
the direction of the formation's eye.

41:06.910 --> 41:08.000
What should we do then?

41:18.870 --> 41:20.510
Take care, Sir. Please come again.

41:23.990 --> 41:25.030
The Juque Sword?

41:27.590 --> 41:28.470
What did you say?

41:31.400 --> 41:32.440
This is the Juque Sword?

41:33.030 --> 41:33.830
Sir, you don't

41:33.860 --> 41:35.100
recognize this sword?

41:36.070 --> 41:37.070
It is said that this sword

41:37.190 --> 41:38.500
was the fifth sword

41:38.500 --> 41:39.470
forged by Ouye Zi.

41:39.830 --> 41:40.710
On the day it was completed,

41:40.710 --> 41:42.590
its aura pierced the sky, emitting a brilliant light.

41:42.710 --> 41:44.760
Today, I've truly seen something great.

41:45.110 --> 41:46.620
Are you sure this is the Juque Sword?

41:47.060 --> 41:48.710
I specifically searched for this sword in the past.

41:48.740 --> 41:49.750
The Juque Sword in the sword diagram

41:49.750 --> 41:50.990
doesn't look like this.

41:51.030 --> 41:52.070
You said it yourself.

41:52.070 --> 41:53.070
It's just a diagram.

41:53.230 --> 41:54.190
After so many years,

41:54.220 --> 41:55.270
people have passed on inaccurate information,

41:55.270 --> 41:56.470
drawing based on imagination.

41:56.830 --> 41:58.110
It can't be very accurate.

41:58.580 --> 42:00.140
Now, you have obtained the precious sword,

42:00.520 --> 42:01.810
yet you fail to recognize it.

42:01.840 --> 42:02.640
This is truly...

42:09.580 --> 42:10.580
I came out this time

42:11.010 --> 42:12.260
just to find it.

42:12.670 --> 42:13.830
Since you want to find it,

42:14.190 --> 42:15.430
I will surely find it for you.

42:17.890 --> 42:18.680
Innkeeper,

42:18.870 --> 42:19.590
where is the young lady

42:19.590 --> 42:20.550
who dined with me yesterday?

42:21.390 --> 42:22.110
That young lady

42:22.110 --> 42:23.750
checked out and left early this morning.

42:24.070 --> 42:24.870
She left?

42:25.290 --> 42:26.460
Do you know where she went?

42:27.040 --> 42:28.600
I have no idea about that.

42:32.010 --> 42:34.290
Are all these for me?

42:34.580 --> 42:36.060
Yes, they're all for you.

42:38.510 --> 42:39.880
They look quite nice.

42:39.950 --> 42:41.200
They're not just nice-looking.

42:41.350 --> 42:42.470
If you wind it up,

42:42.470 --> 42:43.510
it can even move.

42:43.530 --> 42:44.330
Give it a try.

42:52.670 --> 42:54.150
Can I ask you a favor?

42:54.150 --> 42:54.910
Go ahead.

42:55.110 --> 42:56.070
Can you go down the mountain

42:56.070 --> 42:57.350
and buy a roast goose for me?

42:57.950 --> 42:59.240
No problem. Just wait here.

43:00.350 --> 43:01.060
Thanks.

43:01.090 --> 43:01.890
No problem.
